    "Liking": {"Explanation": "Not present. There is no mention of personalization, flattery, or building trust through familiarity with the recipient."},
    "Social proof": {"Explanation": "The email mentions that the winners are selected by a panel of independent experts, storage managers, and the editorial team, and that close to 200 submissions were scrutinized, providing social proof of the quality and recognition of the products listed."}
}

